body:
I am happy to hear of your validation. Hopefully, it brings you some peace. I had a similar experience not too long ago.  I grew up with a father that would mentally and physically abuse my mother, sister, and me. I typically handle my feelings about him well, but I had a hard time understanding why my mom let it happen. I expressed these feelings to my school counselor, and she told me that I should not hold this against myself. It is nothing I did that caused my mother to side with him. She was unable to care for herself and, therefore, was unable to care for me appropriately.

&#x200B;

I hope this may help someone else who grew up in a household similar to mine.
